### Add a listing
POST http://localhost:8080/api/listings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "city": "Lublin",
  "address": "ul. Nadbystrzycka 38",
  "rooms": 2,
  "area": 48.5,
  "price": 2400,
  "parking": true,
  "description": "Bright apartment near the university.",
  "contactName": "Jan Kowalski",
  "contactPhone": "+48 600 100 200",
  "contactEmail": "jan@example.com"
}

### All listings
GET http://localhost:8080/api/listings

### Filter by city
GET http://localhost:8080/api/listings?city=lublin

### Update listing 1
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/listings/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "city": "Lublin",
  "address": "ul. Nadbystrzycka 38",
  "rooms": 2,
  "area": 48.5,
  "price": 2200,
  "parking": false,
  "description": "Price reduced.",
  "contactName": "Jan Kowalski",
  "contactPhone": "+48 600 100 200",
  "contactEmail": "jan@example.com"
}

### Delete listing 1
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/listings/1